gfs2: Move gfs2_remove_from_journal to log.c

jira KERNEL-1718
cve CVE-2026-53049
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.171.1.el8_10
commit-author Andreas Gruenbacher <agruenba@redhat.com>
commit 10866892c79159168459289a1288df4163e94d67
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.171.1.el8_10/10866892.failed

Move gfs2_remove_from_journal() from meta_io.c to log.c and fix a minor
indentation glitch.

With that, gfs2_remove_from_ail() is now only used inside log.c, so it
can be made static.

	Signed-off-by: Andreas Gruenbacher <agruenba@redhat.com>
(cherry picked from commit 10866892c79159168459289a1288df4163e94d67)
	Signed-off-by: Jonathan Maple <jmaple@ciq.com>

